  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あるほんのなかで　アラブルタケとしるされていた　せいぶつはこのポケモンの　かのうせいがある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "어떤 책에 “사나운버섯”이라는 이름으로 기록된 생물이 이 포켓몬일 가능성이 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "某本書裡記載的一種叫做猛惡菇的生物，有可能就是這隻寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est possible que ce Pokémon soit la créature évoquée sous le nom de « Fongus-Furie » dans un certain livre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist gut möglich, dass es sich hierbei um jene Kreatur handelt, die in einem gewissen Buch unter dem Namen Wutpilz auftaucht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es posible que se trate de la criatura que se menciona en cierto libro bajo el nombre de Furioseta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È possibile che la creatura chiamata \"Fungofurioso\" in un certo libro sia proprio questo Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is possible that the creature listed as Brute Bonnet in a certain book could actually be this Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ある本の中で　アラブルタケと記されていた　生物はこのポケモンの　可能性がある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "某本书中记载的一种叫做猛恶菇的生物有可能就是这只宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es posible que se trate de la criatura que se menciona en cierto libro bajo el nombre de Furioseta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あやしい　ざっしが　きょうりゅうとキノコの　ごうせいと　しょうかいしたポケモンに　すこし　にているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "괴상한 잡지에서 공룡과 버섯이 합쳐진 생물이라며 소개했던 포켓몬과 조금 닮은 것 같다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與可疑的雜誌裡被介紹成由恐龍與蘑菇融合而成的寶可夢有點相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble vaguement à un Pokémon mi-dinosaure mi-champignon évoqué dans une revue douteuse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es weist leichte Ähnlichkeit zu einem Pokémon auf, das in einer fragwürdigen Zeitschrift als eine Mischung aus Pilz und Saurier beschrieben wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Guarda un leve parecido con un Pokémon mitad dinosaurio y mitad seta que apareció en un artículo de cierta revista de dudosa veracidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha una certa somiglianza con un Pokémon presentato in una rivista di dubbia attendibilità come una fusione tra un dinosauro e un fungo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It bears a slight resemblance to a Pokémon described in a dubious magazine as a cross between a dinosaur and a mushroom.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "怪しい　雑誌が　恐竜とキノコの　合成と　紹介したポケモンに　少し　似ているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "可疑的杂志曾介绍过某种恐龙与蘑菇合成的宝可梦，该宝可梦与它有些相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
